1
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:08,430
Go Taewoon, Kim Dohyun

2
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:24,900
Baek Seunghoon, Lee Kyungwon

3
00:00:35,910 --> 00:00:43,880
Twisted Tie

4
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:47,170
Episode 3. A Dangerous Bet

5
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:20,960
I brought the additional order list you request...

6
00:01:28,050 --> 00:01:30,720
What are you... right now...

7
00:01:39,060 --> 00:01:40,430
You.

8
00:01:42,600 --> 00:01:44,440
What are you doing...

9
00:02:05,210 --> 00:02:10,210
Are you going to just stand there?
You're interrupting the flow of the meeting.

10
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:18,640
Mr. Lee, distribute the materials and take a seat.

11
00:02:44,079 --> 00:02:48,040
Wow, your hands are incredibly hot.

12
00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:50,130
Do you work out?

13
00:02:51,210 --> 00:02:53,800
You've got quite a useful build.

14
00:02:55,340 --> 00:02:57,640
Let go of me, will you?

15
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:02,890
Mr. Baek.

16
00:03:04,640 --> 00:03:09,190
That's enough messing with my employee, we don't have time.

17
00:03:10,980 --> 00:03:12,780
Too bad.

18
00:03:18,990 --> 00:03:23,040
Team Leader Kang, you look like you wouldn't bleed a drop if pricked,

19
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:28,079
but I really like how hot-blooded
your subordinate is.

20
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:32,590
Did you say his name was Lee Sunwoo?

21
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:35,590
Let's grab a meal together sometime.

22
00:03:48,650 --> 00:03:56,530
Now, shall we see what our amazing Team Leader Kang
has prepared for us?

23
00:04:08,210 --> 00:04:10,790
Please look at the screen.

24
00:04:14,250 --> 00:04:21,050
The main concept for this VVIP lounge
is secrecy, and...

25
00:04:21,050 --> 00:04:23,680
the most important thing

26
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,140
is securing privacy.

27
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:33,440
We've completely separated it into three branches.

28
00:04:41,909 --> 00:04:45,540
[VIP Lounge Interior Design and Material Supply Contract]

29
00:04:45,540 --> 00:04:53,000
Let's sign the contract, we've accommodated
Mr. Baek's requested revisions as much as possible.

30
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:57,710
I believe we've met the contract conditions
sufficiently enough with this.

31
00:04:57,710 --> 00:04:59,880
I know, right.

32
00:05:01,470 --> 00:05:04,600
These numerical conditions are perfect, but...

33
00:05:06,350 --> 00:05:08,100
Hmm...

34
00:05:09,430 --> 00:05:11,520
My heart?

35
00:05:12,850 --> 00:05:16,020
My heart just isn't entirely moved yet.

36
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:29,040
Team Leader Kang.

37
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:35,460
About that newbie from earlier.
Was his name Lee Sunwoo?

38
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:38,000
He's the youngest on our team.

39
00:05:39,090 --> 00:05:43,260
- Please refrain from non-work-related questions.
- Oh, come on, Team Leader Kang.

40
00:05:44,010 --> 00:05:48,470
Don't be so on edge.
Who says I'm going to eat him?

41
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:54,810
It's just... his eyes...

42
00:05:57,860 --> 00:06:00,190
were quite amusing.

43
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:06,820
He follows his master so blindly.

44
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:14,620
Strangely, only when you look away,
his gaze gets incredibly lustful.

45
00:06:14,620 --> 00:06:17,460
What are you trying to say?

46
00:06:17,460 --> 00:06:22,970
No, why... just like a dog off its leash.

47
00:06:22,970 --> 00:06:26,840
He looks like he wants to pounce and tear into you any second,

48
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:32,270
but feels like he's forcing his tail between his legs
because he's scared of his master?

49
00:06:33,390 --> 00:06:39,650
- Well, guys like that are beasts in bed.
- You're crossing the line, Mr. Baek.

50
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:46,659
If you continue like this, this contract...

51
00:06:47,159 --> 00:06:51,950
- We will reconsider it.
- Hey, what do you mean reconsider?

52
00:06:52,659 --> 00:06:54,710
Dojin.

53
00:06:54,710 --> 00:07:01,340
Rumor has it all over our industry that your position as Team Leader
is in danger if this project doesn't succeed?

54
00:07:03,800 --> 00:07:07,050
Let me spend just one night with that newbie.

55
00:07:09,550 --> 00:07:14,100
- What crazy nonsense are you spouting right now?
- Crazy nonsense?

56
00:07:14,730 --> 00:07:16,770
That hurts.

57
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:20,690
I'm proposing a very reasonable business deal.

58
00:07:23,990 --> 00:07:26,780
Let him spend one night with me.

59
00:07:26,780 --> 00:07:31,740
Then I'll stamp this contract right now
on my end and get it done with.

60
00:07:34,540 --> 00:07:40,540
Our Team Leader Kang secures his performance and keeps his position,
and I get to play with a toy I want for a day.

61
00:07:40,540 --> 00:07:42,920
Isn't it a win-win?

62
00:07:42,920 --> 00:07:44,630
You...

63
00:07:45,380 --> 00:07:47,300
are out of your mind.

64
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:52,680
Why are you making such a scary face again?

65
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:56,810
Aren't you Team Leader Kang, who strictly separates personal and professional life?

66
00:07:56,810 --> 00:08:02,610
Sending out a mere new employee to entertain for one night...
What's so hard about that compared to your performance record?

67
00:08:05,030 --> 00:08:07,610
Or...

68
00:08:07,610 --> 00:08:10,110
Are you hiding something?

69
00:08:11,530 --> 00:08:18,580
Some very personal reason...
why he shouldn't be in another man's arms?

70
00:08:20,210 --> 00:08:23,000
I'll give you until next week.

71
00:08:25,500 --> 00:08:30,640
Whether you hand over Mr. Lee and secure the signed contract,

72
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:36,100
or protect a mere newbie
and go back empty-handed...

73
00:08:36,100 --> 00:08:39,390
You make the decision, Team Leader Kang.

74
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:46,540
The place that bastard touched earlier...

75
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:51,720
Is it here?

76
00:09:52,090 --> 00:09:53,840
Sunwoo...

77
00:10:02,480 --> 00:10:04,810
Ah, it hurts... hold on.

78
00:10:07,570 --> 00:10:08,980
Stop.

79
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:10,440
Ah.

80
00:10:11,490 --> 00:10:15,700
Ah, ah it hurts, ah
hold on, Sunwoo...

81
00:10:30,050 --> 00:10:32,010
Ah... Sunwoo, hold on.

82
00:10:37,300 --> 00:10:40,810
I know your life depends on this contract, Mr. Kang,

83
00:10:41,310 --> 00:10:47,900
so even when that bastard was touching your body,
I forced myself not to snap...

84
00:10:50,190 --> 00:10:52,610
I can't hold back a second time.

85
00:10:52,610 --> 00:10:55,780
I really might kill him.

86
00:10:59,530 --> 00:11:01,910
Kill who?

87
00:11:02,950 --> 00:11:05,330
Stop saying useless things and...

88
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:09,170
Erase it, all of it.

89
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:13,210
Cover it up with yours.

90
00:12:56,320 --> 00:13:01,450
Ah, hold on
Ah, slowly, it's too deep...

91
00:14:58,730 --> 00:15:04,990
- You're seriously just ignorantly strong.
- Ah, I'm sorry. Did it hurt?

92
00:15:04,990 --> 00:15:08,240
Ah... I gripped you too tightly...

93
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:12,490
I don't know if I'll even be able to go to work properly tomorrow...

94
00:15:12,490 --> 00:15:15,160
It feels like my whole body is going to shatter...

95
00:15:15,870 --> 00:15:19,540
Should I apply some medicine?
Or I could massage...

96
00:15:19,540 --> 00:15:21,670
It's fine...

97
00:15:21,670 --> 00:15:24,800
Just stay still, I'm dizzy...

98
00:15:35,430 --> 00:15:38,940
Earlier, watching you with Mr. Baek...

99
00:15:38,940 --> 00:15:42,570
It felt like there was a fire burning inside me.

100
00:15:43,190 --> 00:15:47,610
- I know I shouldn't act like that, but...
- If you know, keep it in moderation.

101
00:15:48,700 --> 00:15:50,870
I'm Kang Dojin...

102
00:15:52,580 --> 00:15:57,210
Do I look like such a pushover
that I can't handle one guy like him?

103
00:15:58,540 --> 00:16:02,750
No... I know you're perfect, Mr. Kang. But...

104
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:09,300
I still hate it.
Anyone laying a single fingertip on you.

105
00:16:11,180 --> 00:16:13,470
I hated it too.

106
00:16:14,260 --> 00:16:15,680
What?

107
00:16:17,890 --> 00:16:20,770
Others touching my body...

108
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:24,320
I loathe it.

109
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:29,450
Earlier, when his hand touched me...

110
00:16:31,870 --> 00:16:35,620
It felt so filthy I wanted to wash it off immediately.

111
00:16:42,920 --> 00:16:47,460
But you didn't feel filthy.
Strangely...

112
00:16:49,130 --> 00:16:51,640
It's been like that since the beginning...

113
00:16:53,430 --> 00:16:55,390
Mr. Kang...

114
00:16:57,180 --> 00:17:00,600
So stop making such a stupid face.

115
00:17:00,600 --> 00:17:04,359
Someone might think you forced yourself on me.

116
00:17:06,819 --> 00:17:12,200
Do I look like the kind of person who gives up this bed...
to just anyone?

117
00:17:18,579 --> 00:17:23,040
What you just said...
for the rest of my life...

118
00:17:24,079 --> 00:17:26,750
I won't forget it.

119
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:34,720
Be quiet... stop making me talk
and just hold me... I'm tired.

120
00:17:36,260 --> 00:17:38,930
Yes, understood.

121
00:18:57,720 --> 00:19:00,470
Woojae, right there, just a little more...

122
00:19:20,330 --> 00:19:26,420
Twisted Tie
